---
cuisine: Mexican
servings: 8
portion: 160 g
---

Add diced @onion{1}, @sunflower oil{4%tbsp} and @tomato puree{1 1/2%tbsp} into #pan{} at low-medium flame. Don't let them go brown

Add @chicken{350%g}, @garlic paste{1 1/2%tbsp}, @ginger paste{1 1/2%tbsp}, @yellow pepper{1/8} and @red pepper{1/8} into the pan at medium heat. Then add @salt{2%tsp}, @black pepper{1/2%tsp}, @paprika{2%tsp} and @cayenne pepper{1/2%tsp}

Take chicken out (sieve out curry), use #stand mixer{} to shred and put back in

Spread @avocado{3 1/2} onto @tortilla wrap{8}. Squeeze @lime{1/2} and add @jalapeno{1/2} when serving